  "label": "Misogynous Humor",
  "description": "A form of humor that relies on sexist or misogynistic stereotypes to entertain, often at the expense of women. It perpetuates harmful gender norms by mocking women's competence, intelligence, or societal roles. The meme uses this type of humor to mock the idea of women having power by suggesting it's absurd and should be corrected by returning women to domestic roles.",
